# Dataset

This folder is reserved for the dataset used for training and developing the LAWPRO Indian legal AI system.

The original training dataset is **not included in this GitHub repository because of its large file size**.

The dataset contains Indian legal-domain information used to adapt the AI model for legal question answering.

## Dataset Details

- **Format:** JSONL (JSON Lines)
- **Rows/Records:21,576
- **File Size:** Approximately 52 MB
- **Purpose:** Training and development of the Indian legal AI model

